{"title":"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Line segments <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/b/7ab17967324fc2b12349c0610c6c256f4c829162.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/3/7631e00d1deb6ad3d55301906009f15d342e412a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$RS$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> intersect at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2554b6496c3b678897e9b060ef00aa9f0a7d7ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, as shown. \n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/5/885930411a5ace06460bf0eed665ef8af0bb21f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$TS = TQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"79\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/c/8fc9f82734aa85b20814b9244f4e66904a605a35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle PTR = 88^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"106\" height=\"15\" />, the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/8/4c8e2d9303e0aadf667465ca01539992304b17c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 44 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 46 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 88 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 45 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/8/9984be071e245d5cbb3d0f7d041db0a0b0f1952e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m \\angle PTR = m \\angle STQ = 88^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"215\" height=\"18\" /> because they are <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vertical_angles\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vertical angles\">vertical angles</a>. We can now focus solely on triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/f/0cf829cbbb95991f3decd53a84859a8e9ba0b046.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$STQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/5/885930411a5ace06460bf0eed665ef8af0bb21f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$TS = TQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"79\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/6/f2676c03893681ba272dcc6dccf86480c3a3e4de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle TSQ = m \\angle SQT = x^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"205\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>The sum of the interior angles of any triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/0/3f0cd95f95238159d02dbcea0aca632c2928991c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"15\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/6/ed62303aaaf5bf8c6188a568587d6f85c6a60573.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{\\circ} + x^{\\circ} + 88^{\\circ} = 180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"167\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/0/ca048ab1cd243c08fa3256df319cad02d392e1dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x + 88^{\\circ} = 180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"128\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/5/ed58ba89ff05587d6f43798b592d8a952ece2677.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x = 180^{\\circ} - 88^{\\circ} = 92^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"179\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/4/294d58c3baea3b8a3594b22034be77c1aa7e237c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{92}{2} = \\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 46}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"147\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher \n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/P